  "details": "Description\n\nSo, I sometimes use Shift to run in the maps, but I stop and sometimes attempt to go to the menu too fast, which activate safety mode by accident, removing it is only possible via a very tedious playing around the said menu while accidentally activating it is literally \"a walk in the park\"\n\nReproduction Steps\n\n1. Run around with shift + WASD\n\n2. Stop running and select esc fast enough\n\n3. The safety mode activate\n\n4. Trying to do the set again, impossible to desactivate. need to do a tedious way to remove it from an accidental on...\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Interface utilisateur\n\n- Frequency: Souvent\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.2-1953-d52354d5be-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-26_17-22-02.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_7638b45d-63f1-46bf-8965-beac43453509/1/file)",
